    "detailed_description": "<h1>Graphic Settings Update</h1><p>Following a <strong>user's feedback</strong>, we decided to add few in-game options, even if very basic, to allow changing the <strong>graphical settings</strong> in case you're experiencing sub-optimal performance.</p><br><h1>Localization Update</h1><p>Looking at our playerbase, we decided to add localization for the in-game UI and the store page.<br><br>The Russian localization was tool-assisted, so we are sorry for any mistaken translation or adaptation.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Mec Me Loffa</strong> is an FPS experience in which the player will have to face a series of <strong>waves</strong> consisting of enemies of different kinds, including a boss. The player must navigate through the challenges using their <strong>weapons</strong> to defeat the cursed spirits that aim to undermine their career as a comedian.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958770/extras/81aa81f3c61f7ba9363a7560459ea8a9.avif?t=1718698986\" width=616 height=257 /></span>",
